Subject: attention-gateway P1 — canonical-ref dedup (v2, adversarial-review hardened)

GERMLINE CARRY NOTE: the two framework/acting lane modules in this patch are
germline (read-only for officers and loops; hook + schg on the live
checkout). This patch is the on-branch carry of the P1 change: authored from
scratch copies, applied to the feature branch with `git apply`, reviewed in
the PR diff. The Captain's merge (plus the live-checkout germline relock
cycle) IS the apply step.

v2 (post-gauntlet, 2026-07-08): batch-local covered accumulation (one LLM
response can no longer double-card a situation), id-grade vs path-only drop
reasons, and a 14d covered-evidence window (an all-time ledger read let one
old card citing a rolling digest file mute that file's future situations
forever; the window bounds it).

